===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|governement}}, from {{der|en|fro|governement}} (modern French {{m|fr|gouvernement}}), from {{m|fro|governer}} (see {{m|en|govern}}) + {{m|fro|-ment}}.

Morphologically {{suffix|en|govern|ment|nocat=1}}

Displaced native {{noncog|ang|gerec}}, {{m|ang|leodweard}}, {{m|ang|ræden}}, {{m|ang|rǣding}} and {{inh|en|ang|ealdordōm}}.

